**/caddy
frankenphp

# frankenphp-worker.php (public/) is deliberately NOT ignored, despite
# `octane:install` adding it here by default — the Docker build's builder
# stage runs a completely clean composer install with no chance to
# re-generate it, and it's a tiny, static stub (see Octane's own stub at
# vendor/laravel/octane/src/Commands/stubs/frankenphp-worker.php) that
# never needs regenerating unless Octane's own internal path changes, so
# committing it once is simpler than teaching the Dockerfile to run
# `octane:install` on every build.
